{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your INVENTORIX device\u00a0(crafted by space gnomes) to extract maximum value from interstellar items and recruit aliens to boost your earnings. Pay off a mysterious debt or push your luck to create astronomical wealth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/extras/GamePlaySNF04_Page.gif?t=1744933946\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features (Demo, More to Come)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Galactic profits</strong>: Earn cosmic cash, ka-ching, ka-ching, ka-ching!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Inventory Management</strong>: Pack items and aliens to uncover powerful combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>80 Items</strong>: Pick them wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>75 Alien Perks</strong>: Which ones best support your build?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>10+ Item Classes</strong>: Go all-in on a single class or mix them up for cosmic synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Roguelike:</strong> Fast, replayable runs packed with variety.<strong> </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>7 INVENTORIX Devices</strong>: Unlock them and explore unique strategies with each. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>7 Difficulty Levels</strong>: Conquer escalating challenges. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Codex: </strong>Complete your Codex by identifying new items and aliens.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2500460?t=1744933946","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744933946","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500460/3a1b0b655079370f09f7eaf002cba6c6459d612e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744933946","